node_modules/
.pnpm-store/

# Release artifacts. The tarball the dsh-market entry points at is built by
# `pnpm pack` from the tagged commit and uploaded to a GitHub Release; a stale
# one sitting in the tree is how a release ships the previous build.
*.tgz

# Mnemon memory store. Session-local, continuously mutated runtime state
# (memories.json, generated MEMORY.md/USER.md projections, and the document
# index/entities under documents/). Nothing here is a shared, versionable
# project artifact, so it is never committed.
.mnemon/
